{"title":"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Substitution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Substitution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Also_Substitution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Also Substitution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7_(Easy_System_of_Equations)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7 (Easy System of Equations)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_8_(Definition_of_Logarithm)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 8 (Definition of Logarithm)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a Martian civilization, all logarithms whose bases are not specified are assumed to be base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, for some fixed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/29714969923bce7e922fa6021bb9611d364fb96a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\ge2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />. A Martian student writes down\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/d/edd14880fb8a07eb5e444758008df636655d25fa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\log(\\sqrt{x}\\log x)=56\\]\" width=\"156\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/f/a4f7d9de7f66eef8b9752b307cdda8a029dbc98b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{\\log x}(x)=54\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" />\nand finds that this system of equations has a single real number solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66db4e19b3be56d841f02880243f258ec5d1e88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using change of base on the second equation to base b,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/7/da792526df0e8383578a6287185c4927eff04d76.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log x}{\\log \\log_{b}{x}}=54\\]\" width=\"114\" height=\"42\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a97624f6ff6b4e22fd0f4c9ff38d6b6c9179009c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log x = 54 \\cdot \\log\\log_{b}{x}\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d65555bcd908194906ee1662ef55488960341d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = (\\log_{b}{x})^{54}\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />\nNote by dolphin7 - you could also just rewrite the second equation in exponent form.\n</p><p>Substituting this into the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aa027abf288d84604eb02f64f3b9485aa648ed7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> of the first equation,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/732bab779b0720ad4c92c18a73dac6ca3a1e9a69.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\log_{b}{((\\log_{b}{x})^{27}\\log_{b}{x})} = 56\\]\" width=\"219\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/5/e35f81a586bfcc540b0a5b438037d7281112fa98.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\log_{b}{(\\log_{b}{x})^{28}} = 56\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/d/5fd8e0661b37c18bf8e06e1fddeedc6ff3f1a9c2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{b}{(\\log_{b}{x})^{84}} = 56\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We can manipulate this equation to be able to substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/8/97867b4073fddf84c5820ba3115c54554feff558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = (\\log_{b}{x})^{54}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"108\" height=\"21\" /> a couple more times:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/b/4ab8816b6827e2de73f84ed6cad1158557f2e729.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{b}{(\\log_{b}{x})^{54}} = 56 \\cdot \\frac{54}{84}\\]\" width=\"180\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/f/fef38541e8b56d409d6ce887be75e3359019069c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{b}{x} = 36\\]\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c653e70890ed5cf16ac416eeab8aaac5ffc30b12.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log_{b}{x})^{54} = 36^{54}\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/627365b85149d5158f48cbfb0044770173ab5016.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 6^{108}\\]\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>However, since we found that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/f/d3f7d3a1ae2652c5ed7a2e2aeb16308de18ffb46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{b}{x} = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is also equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0de7247d07cbc517cf4ce12240a9cdd71e74f69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{36}$\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />. Equating these,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/523bdb1d74bfee78c672bb44d6f739ca59ec62f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{36} = 6^{108}\\]\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fcc283ea20c219448778290bd3b586d051ea06f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = 6^3 = \\boxed{216}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We start by simplifying the first equation to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/9/939cef163fa98d8bfc33dc6879f0eb8de4b23546.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\log_{b}{(\\sqrt{x}\\log x)}=\\log_{b}{(x^{\\frac{3}{2}}\\log^3x)}=56\\]\" width=\"306\" height=\"22\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72fd9f46cfe74e77afc92629dc92b327f970c0cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot \\log_b^3x=b^{56}\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"22\" />\nNext, we simplify the second equation to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cdda455b00bba223211e9041eb0cfba514925068.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{\\log(x)}(x)=\\frac{\\log_b(x)}{\\log_b(\\log_b(x))}=54\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/4/f847bd2e3cb3abbef6c030353f355754f86bf4ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_bx=54\\log_b(\\log_b(x))=\\log_b(\\log_b^{54}(x))\\]\" width=\"316\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ff0fbb4d09a1ea99fe25e97d6cd6f82a953752d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\log_b^{54}x\\]\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" />\nSubstituting this into the first equation gives \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/6/c86abea3843ba393f3726015b9a6a866f03470b4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_b^{54\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}}(x)\\cdot \\log_b^3x=\\log_b^{84}x=b^{56}\\]\" width=\"253\" height=\"25\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/c/f1ca88fd5feca0324898e23d3e19d643abc250f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=b^{b^{\\frac{56}{84}}}=b^{b^{\\frac{2}{3}}}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"22\" />\nPlugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edfb1836d2a29a6feb6811eb9f5f0aef00a85835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\log_b^{54}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" /> gives \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/7/2d7d8d4d3209b3949d8b7f5c909159fb7f49aa37.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{b^{\\frac{2}{3}}}=\\log_b^{54}(b^{b^\\frac{2}{3}})=b^{\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot 54}=b^{36}\\]\" width=\"230\" height=\"26\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/3397b75dcf632a185dc9ceb0cb55fde610f44b1f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{\\frac{2}{3}}=36\\]\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/0/9f0b0bc7d6bda1ebdbf71c13b37fcaaf67b3e29c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=36^{\\frac{3}{2}}=6^3=\\boxed{216}\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"23\" />\n-ktong\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Apply change of base to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/f/a4f7d9de7f66eef8b9752b307cdda8a029dbc98b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{\\log x}(x)=54\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" /> to yield: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/0/6a0bdd0b431c65a028309a4d20c752c670d6ceaf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log_b(x)}{\\log_b(\\log_b(x))}=54\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"43\" />\nwhich can be rearranged as:  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/6/cb68e6c66d8d82479a35dd7bade5275c581fd836.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log_b(x)}{54}=\\log_b(\\log_b(x))\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"39\" />\nApply log properties to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/d/edd14880fb8a07eb5e444758008df636655d25fa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\log(\\sqrt{x}\\log x)=56\\]\" width=\"156\" height=\"19\" /> to yield: \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32ed7121c40f0d3d6f47798fa1b272f5f7ede371.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3(\\frac{1}{2}\\log_b(x)+\\log_b(\\log_b(x)))=56\\Rightarrow\\frac{1}{2}\\log_b(x)+\\log_b(\\log_b(x))=\\frac{56}{3}\\]\" width=\"506\" height=\"37\" />\nSubstituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/6/cb68e6c66d8d82479a35dd7bade5275c581fd836.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log_b(x)}{54}=\\log_b(\\log_b(x))\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"39\" /> into the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/6/116253f6754da7ba864a7baa7f64795f172fbb35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\log_b(x)+\\log_b(\\log_b(x))=\\frac{56}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"236\" height=\"37\" /> yields: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1f0ef646894df91a4e242576f094cd7b3b842e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2}\\log_b(x)+\\frac{\\log_b(x)}{54}=\\frac{28\\log_b(x)}{54}=\\frac{56}{3}\\]\" width=\"298\" height=\"39\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec1df14c0202e21f4a33cc755c594956db7143a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_b(x)=36.\\]\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />\nSubstituting this back in to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/6/cb68e6c66d8d82479a35dd7bade5275c581fd836.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log_b(x)}{54}=\\log_b(\\log_b(x))\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"39\" /> yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f073afb5622d44b79019813bbe0731a5497b4bee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{36}{54}=\\log_b(36).\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />\nSo,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37ee1a897cff8515ac6839db87bf3b56649aaf3d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{\\frac{2}{3}}=36\\Rightarrow \\boxed{b=216}\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>-Ghazt2002\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>1st equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/f/f4fd6f5bbf6de5cc37e531a6eb5647417a54fc13.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log (\\sqrt{x}\\log x)=\\frac{56}{3}\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"37\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb7e35a146c025a0a6caab1434496b7c16316513.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log(\\sqrt x)+\\log(\\log x)=\\frac{1}{2}\\log x+\\log(\\log x)=\\frac{56}{3}\\]\" width=\"378\" height=\"37\" /> 2nd equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0596ebf7342a981b1fef755ecd12510ce8572c4a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=(\\log x)^{54}\\]\" width=\"98\" height=\"19\" /> So now substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/5/665a686791a0f3382f713173e0799899f6ca3546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log x=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8f86458d517afffadf763772219ce5765279e1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=b^a$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e7d711e8895eef4850e75f60b2aa9e604d763e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^a=a^{54}\\]\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/5/265d6ac1427be8a840b6ccdf16e5b822af049710.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=a^{\\frac{54}{a}}\\]\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> We also have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/0/ca018c691b9d6bf3fe8b6b53b477f871b22882c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2}a+\\log_{a^\\frac{54}{a}} a=\\frac{56}{3}\\]\" width=\"148\" height=\"37\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4b3fade688445a5ba86d3b78c6d2e31a7b79c91.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2}a+\\frac{1}{54}a=\\frac{56}{3}\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"38\" /> This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c6428dbd7a687428d3125e239ed356c8093a5e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{14}{27}a=\\frac{56}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"76\" height=\"37\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f547fdcdb24fc36103e57139216d8a21b37a429d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=36\\]\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c10bddb6bad6c577904b27af4e67a04118972bcd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=36^{\\frac{54}{36}}=36^\\frac{3}{2}=\\boxed{216}\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>-Stormersyle\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Substitution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Substitution)\">Solution 5 (Substitution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Substitution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0cc2bd69db8cd6076670201f0ce6875139c693f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\log _{b} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />\nThen we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/a/d2ae4aa6dc1639c83db684a12bbf1fdeeffc47a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\log _{b} (y\\sqrt{x}) = 56\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/8/978727e7f24cf7c593259b8c7c9a54729306dc05.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log _{y} x = 54\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" />\nwhich gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/986a0be4c4506bf618afe6483b36980e63501895.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^{54} = x\\]\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />\nPlugging this in gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/f/ccfa1f564442a54030adc80e50def161e4ff9e92.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\log _{b} (y \\cdot y^{27}) = 3\\log _{b} y^{28} = 56\\]\" width=\"237\" height=\"19\" />\nwhich gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/0/a00ad993a98969882d6bcdb05c655460415fcea1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log _{b} y = \\dfrac{2}{3}\\]\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" />\nso\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/d/80d646306f48fdc28048f9aa3787eb6d322f8ddd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{2/3} = y\\]\" width=\"61\" height=\"19\" />\nBy substitution we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc6cdb0df7fbbd597a57a8442def312efdc25e57.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{36} = x\\]\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />\nwhich gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/2/632df8884f1be457eb42d064e3f11d335e6ecf11.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = \\log _{b} x = 36\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />\nPlugging in again we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb44f9d783d2e15905d6c9e17b163561373c5c16.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = 36^{3/2} = \\fbox{216}\\]\" width=\"131\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>--Hi3142\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Also_Substitution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Also_Substitution)\">Solution 6 (Also Substitution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Also Substitution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This system of equations looks complicated to work with, so we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b35986ec9ab2c2734a57acac19775c60b99a2ebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\log_bx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"19\" /> to make it easier for us to read. \n</p><p>Now, the first equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/5/f95d8b94851962da74719e347ff9b7820fd6d2a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\log(\\sqrt x \\cdot a) = 56 \\implies \\log(\\sqrt{x}\\cdot a)=\\frac{56}3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"324\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>The second equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30cd4e118d17f8bf7aa35923778c3c24a1ab2f05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{\\log(x)}(x)=54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"128\" height=\"23\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/d/e6d7dfdb7c99e4e71284685364759309aea6d0ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{a^{54} = x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Let's plug this back into the first equation to see what we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/8/f48f54d8431ee4f65415086a1ff9cce8602cc82b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b(\\sqrt{a^{54}}\\cdot a)=\\frac{56}3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"154\" height=\"38\" />, and simplifying, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdb3157088ffdeceb173dbd7a4ccbcad4ca0cf4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b(a^{27}\\cdot a^1)=\\log_b(a^{28})=\\frac{56}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"239\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/a/26a67a48e37fac81805ea8e0cf23e48f639ffd3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{\\frac{56}3}=a^{28}\\implies \\underline{b^{\\frac 23}=a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"175\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>Combining this new finding with what we had above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d1f4fe01645dff9758fcbd8b3454f67a4ebe4b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{54} = (b^{\\frac 23})^{54} = x\\implies \\mathbf{b^{36} =x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"243\" height=\"24\" />. \n</p><p>Now that we've expressed one variable in terms of the other, we can plug this into either equation, say equation 1. Then we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/a/13a07111bf3baaecc5682e7d1d98594f201329d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b(\\sqrt{b^{36}}\\cdot\\log_b(b^{36})=\\frac{56}3\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"246\" height=\"38\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/627b2a9d9cd77251669b1ff903cad98dc99ad57d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b(b^{18}\\cdot 36)=\\frac{56}3\\implies b^{\\frac{56}3}=b^{18}\\cdot 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"297\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>Finally, that gives us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/7/1c72f2281380adcda5cc46ffd78d11ca9909c2b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b^{\\frac{56}3}}{b^{18}}=36\\implies b^{\\frac{56}{3}-18}=b^{\\frac{56}{3}-\\frac{54}{3}}=b^{\\frac 23}=36\\implies b=36^{\\frac 32}=6^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"479\" height=\"43\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/4/2c48afe55489072dc17d04c2d6da45656ece8a3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\boxed{216}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~BakedPotato66\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_7_.28Easy_System_of_Equations.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7_(Easy_System_of_Equations)\">Solution 7 (Easy System of Equations)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7 (Easy System of Equations)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using change of base on the second equation, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/a/eda82b771dc5d15b1dad5e51f050b7c1b70527ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{\\log_{b} x}{\\log_{b} \\log_{b} x} = 54\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Using log rules on the first equation, we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/0/4b0c64164ec4586d96999770298acae161fd329a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3}{2} \\log_{b} x + 3 \\log_{b} \\log_{b} x = 56\\]\" width=\"210\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>We notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/1672fbac2b4e8bdcba7884d66ea4b1613431649f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{b} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"45\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/4/07407bc22aea5e724161837d3d4e6c0e93bd96ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{b} \\log_{b} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"19\" /> are in both equations. Thus, we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/8/e98bd445a66bdaa0c8209b013a0127f62c2558b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\log_{b} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0eb6912f410416863968497c0cb7c602fa0a100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\log_{b} \\log_{b} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"19\" /> and we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/792c67157f20c1fd2299be4aba99fedcf376dc41.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{3}{2} m + 3n = 56\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0028565306552f38e1b956e01763642dcbd0d7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{m}{n} = 54\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>Solving this yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/9/fa91a1c9aa24037ad3d0a2bf448bf8e5d8cc7ad0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccaf50897d219105d9a8a64fe8ac8e9a6ba410d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Now, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f09dc1750d34751f0f5045d7023e6bc5eaf250c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\log_{b} \\log_{b} x = \\log_{b} m = \\log_{b} 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"263\" height=\"19\" />, so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/4/124df3de142f1e612f3aea0fc95526aa57547146.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{b} 36 = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />. Solving this yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/e/e5e3095289a69efa49581ce26be12b8e8919a944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\boxed{216}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"72\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~ adam_zheng\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_8_.28Definition_of_Logarithm.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_8_(Definition_of_Logarithm)\">Solution 8 (Definition of Logarithm)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 8 (Definition of Logarithm)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The second equation implies that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/9/069366b0daa7b1d1cf583d74d721b50ca5e1cbdd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{\\log_b x} x=54\\implies (\\log_b x)^{54}=x \\implies \\log_b x=x^{\\frac{1}{54}}\\]\" width=\"410\" height=\"25\" />\nThe first equation implies that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aabc62676c49bd3d4657c2d8710906398c50b5d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3\\log_b(\\sqrt{x} \\log_b x)=56 \\implies b^{\\frac{56}{3}}=\\sqrt{x} \\log_b x\\]\" width=\"340\" height=\"22\" />\nSubstituting the first result into the second gives us \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/c/fdcc72140b0c1b34744d03d60af7b106cb28707a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b^{\\frac{56}{3}}=x^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\cdot x^{\\frac{1}{54}} \\implies b=x^{\\frac{1}{36}}.\\]\" width=\"220\" height=\"18\" />\nBecause <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/a/18a258f4ff16bc218a68bf679a77501088bd9853.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{36}=x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/1/4a1368e9146b97807d8fb96b26f6cc81609d5bc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b x=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"19\" /> by the definition of a logarithm.\nSubstituting this into the second equation,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc904e2c18a0dea98057c992c1943edab6ddfce2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{36} x=54 \\implies x=36^{54}.\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"20\" />\nFinally, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/e/42eab6e1b5b77be310237ed1e1cc14aac1f36569.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=(36^{54})^{\\frac{1}{36}}=36^{54\\cdot\\frac{1}{36}}=6^{2*\\frac{3}{2}}=6^3=\\boxed{216}.\\]\" width=\"334\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II\" title=\"2019 AIME II\">2019 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2019\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2019 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017195559\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 595/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 19041/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.965      1 -total\n 55.28%    7.720      1 Template:AIME_box\n 43.21%    6.034      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17360:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017195559 and revision id 238467. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}